<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Pay2View — Install as an App & Earn Faster</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #000;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ad-container {
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #111;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #ccc;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 26px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aaa;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="ad-container">

    <h2>Hello {{username}}</h2>
    <h2>Pay2View is Now an App 📱</h2>

    <p>
      Good news — you can now install <strong>Pay2View as an app</strong> on both 
      <strong>iPhone</strong> and <strong>Android</strong> without using the App Store or Play Store.
    </p>

    <p>
      Installing Pay2View makes it faster to upload content, share your paid links,
      and manage your earnings — just like a normal app.
    </p>

    <p><strong>How to install on iPhone (Safari):</strong><br>
      1. Open Pay2View in Safari<br>
      2. Tap the <strong>Share</strong> icon<br>
      3. Select <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>
    </p>

    <p><strong>How to install on Android (Chrome):</strong><br>
      1. Open Pay2View in Chrome<br>
      2. Tap the <strong>3 dots</strong> menu<br>
      3. Select <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>
    </p>

    <p>
      Once installed, you can open Pay2View anytime, upload content,
      and share your paid links directly on WhatsApp, Instagram, X, or Telegram.
    </p>

    <a href="https://www.pay2view.io/dashboard" class="cta" target="_blank">
      Open Pay2View & Install
    </a>

    <div class="footer-note">
      Pay2View © 2026 — Monetise your content your way
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
